# Dependent-origination core spine v1.0

This aggregate deliberately returns to the non-quantum parent architecture.

The core hierarchy is:

```text
context category
  -> state-valued functor
  -> composable contextual transport
  -> transport-compatible maps between systems
  -> change of contextual lens by functorial pullback
  -> reversible presentation only when extra groupoid structure is present
  -> free finite history as a one-object specialization
  -> memory-lifted history as an enlarged-state specialization
```

No Choi matrix, completely-positive map, process tensor, Hamiltonian, spectral
gap, or physical Yang--Mills theorem is part of this aggregate.

Those constructions may remain downstream realizations.  They do not define the
meaning of dependent origination at the parent level.
-/

